title: JSON
id: transports-json
order: 9
description: "Send each chat run as one plain JSON response with fetchJson and toJsonResponse, for hosts and proxies that buffer or break streams, and poll long runs with resumeJsonResponse."
keywords:
  - tanstack ai
  - json transport
  - non-streaming chat
  - fetchJson
  - toJsonResponse
  - resumeJsonResponse
  - polling
  - serverless timeout
---
